        "original_id": "cb07c367-c496-5e31-af50-299322c75b3b",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Tom Clegg\n- Projects: Carry On films, Carry On Screaming!, Carry On franchise\n- Topics: English acting career, British comedy productions\n\nFacts:\n- Tom Clegg was an English actor who lived from 1915 to 1996.\n- During the 1950s, 1960s, and 1970s, Tom Clegg had a number of small roles in film and television.\n- Tom Clegg is known for appearing in several Carry On films, especially Carry On Screaming!.\n- From 1958 to 1992, the Carry On franchise primarily consisted of 31 low-budget British comedy motion pictures.\n- The Carry On franchise also included four Christmas specials, a television series of thirteen episodes, and three West End and provincial stage plays.",
